                  <items count="7">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Pick a site on a satellite map: search an address or place (Nominatim / Photon, OpenStreetMap data), click or drag the pin, then "Use this location". Latitude and Longitude (WGS84 degrees) go into LiDAR Site, Site Context or any component that takes a site. The pick is saved with the document. Imagery: Esri World Imagery; map: © OpenStreetMap contributors. Needs an internet connection.

