                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Every driveable road around a site from OpenStreetMap, as Road Sources with STREET-TYPE DEFAULTS for traffic: a residential street a few hundred vehicles a day, a primary road fifteen thousand, a motorway sixty thousand. A posted maxspeed wins over the class speed; four lanes carry twice the two-lane default. These are placeholders for a count — override the roads that matter with Road Source. Roads are placed in metres east/north of the site, at z = 0.

