                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Where the buildings come from. Global Building Atlas: LoD1 footprints worldwide with heights PREDICTED by a model (RMSE 1.5-8.9 m; TUM, CC BY-NC 4.0 — non-commercial use), read straight from the published tiles. OpenStreetMap: mapped footprints with the height tag or building:levels x 3 m, else the Fallback Height (ODbL; via the public Overpass mirrors, which can queue for minutes). The height KIND of every building is on its mesh and in the report.</item>
